<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Freddie Mac cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Freddie Mac cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said it downgraded Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corp or &quot;Freddie Mac&quot; to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Freddie Mac lost 1/8 to 34-3/4.</p>
</text>
